  "description": "An on-screen gamepad for .NET MAUI - NES, SNES, Xbox/PlayStation, twin-stick and arcade layouts as a game overlay or an inline controller, with multi-touch sticks and d-pads, turbo, haptics, a drag-and-pinch layout editor, and auto-hide when a real controller connects. It is a Shiny.Gamepad IGamepad, so game code reads it exactly like hardware.",
